{"ticker":"RVTY","updated":"2026-10-23T23:59:42Z","profile":{"longName":"Revvity, Inc.","shortName":"Revvity, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.revvity.com","fullTimeEmployees":11000,"marketCap":17716574208,"trailingPE":75.966515,"forwardPE":26.935598,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.084383,"pegRatio":0.73,"targetMeanPrice":147.53333,"targetHighPrice":175.0,"targetLowPrice":110.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.013,"earningsGrowth":0.012,"grossMargins":0.54976004,"operatingMargins":0.17052999,"profitMargins":0.08158,"totalRevenue":2911811072,"beta":1.064,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":166.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":81.22,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.18},"summary":"Revvity, Inc. provides health sciences solutions, technologies, and services. The company offers instruments, reagents, software, subscriptions, detection and imaging technologies, extended warranties, and training and services; and instruments, reagents, and assay platforms and software products for early detection of common and rare conditions, such as pregnancy and early childhood, as well as infectious disease testing in the diagnostics market. Its products are used for testing and screening genetic abnormalities, disorders, and diseases, including down syndrome, hypothyroidism, muscular dystrophy, infertility, and various metabolic conditions. It also develops technologies that enable and support genomic workflows using protein coupled receptors and next-generation DNA sequencing for oncology, immunodiagnostics, and drug discovery. It serves pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies, laboratories, academic and research institutions, public health authorities, private healthcare organizations, doctors, and government agencies under the AutoDELFIA, chemagic, Chitas, CNGnome, DELFIA, DELFIA Xpress, EONIS, EUROArray, EUROIMMUN, EUROLabWorkstation, EUROLINE, EUROPattern, Evolution Evoya, GSP, Haoyuan, IDS Immunodiagnosticsystems, IDS-i10, IDS-i10T, IDS-i20, IDS-iSYS, iLab, iQ, LifeCycle, LimsLink, Migele, NeoBase, NeoLSD, NEXTFLEX, Panthera Puncher, PreNAT II, Prime, RONIA, Si","summary_zh":"Revvity, Inc. 提供健康科學解決方案、技術和服務。該公司提供儀器、試劑、軟體、訂閱、檢測和成像技術、延長保固以及培訓和服務；以及用於早期檢測常見和罕見病症（例如懷孕和幼兒期）以及診斷市場中的傳染病檢測的儀器、試劑、檢測平台和軟體產品。其產品用於測試和篩檢遺傳異常、失調和疾病，包括唐氏症、甲狀腺功能減退症、肌肉萎縮症、不孕症和各種代謝狀況。它還開發技術，使用蛋白質偶聯受體和下一代 DNA 測序來實現和支持基因組工作流程，用於腫瘤學、免疫診斷和藥物發現。它為 AutoDELFIA、chemagic、Chitas、CNGnome、DELFIA、DELFIA Xpress、EONIS、EUROArray、EUROMMUN、EUROLabWorkstation、EUROLINE、EUROPattern、Evolution Evoya、GSP、Hayuan、IDS 免疫診斷系統、ID IDS-i10、IDS-i10T、IDS-i20、IDS-iSYS、iLab、iQ、LifeCycle、LimsLink、Migele、NeoBase、NeoLSD、NEXTFLEX、Panthera Puncher、PreNAT II、Prime、RONIA、Si","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":93.92,"h":94.2,"l":91.51,"c":92.14,"v":699600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":92.19,"h":92.53,"l":90.99,"c":91.23,"v":2115600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":90.67,"h":91.74,"l":88.34,"c":88.59,"v":1619300},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":88.43,"h":89.51,"l":87.64,"c":89.23,"v":790400},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":89.04,"h":90.35,"l":88.56,"c":90.11,"v":786200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":89.43,"h":89.63,"l":86.41,"c":87.87,"v":1302600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":85.84,"h":85.97,"l":82.05,"c":83.36,"v":2475000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":83.12,"h":85.78,"l":81.36,"c":85.7,"v":1245200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":85.99,"h":88.12,"l":85.51,"c":86.64,"v":1193600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":85.72,"h":86.49,"l":84.72,"c":86.28,"v":1026700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":86.44,"h":86.44,"l":84.99,"c":85.04,"v":907500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":84.75,"h":85.57,"l":82.47,"c":82.5,"v":1428500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":82.76,"h":85.86,"l":82.59,"c":85.68,"v":833800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":85.34,"h":85.39,"l":82.71,"c":82.87,"v":1126100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":83.0,"h":84.13,"l":81.69,"c":84.0,"v":1304700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":84.1,"h":85.69,"l":83.58,"c":85.28,"v":1196100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":86.0,"h":88.49,"l":84.84,"c":85.3